Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, mama, lots of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun, you're\Nso cool, no, blah, blah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill or kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.79,0:01:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill, kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill, kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:01:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill, kill our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for the test of\Ncourage, but where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old shrine, but safety first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path is dangerous\Nwithout any ghosties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we put a cute photo op halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be handing out selfie sticks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one for every two people\Nso no one gets separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward, you brave souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all make memories\Nwe'll treasure forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato, this'll be your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely even you've heard of\Nthe suspension bridge effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you cross one, you mistake your heart\Nracing for liking whoever you're with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same for ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, mood is key. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't start seizing\Nthis kind of opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to end up\Nsingle the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does Kinosaki seem so into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked for help getting\Nmarried, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say thank you for\Nsticking with me and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pretend\Nthis isn't a total pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it would have made your job a\Nlot easier if instead of coming here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just stayed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only so many options in the\Nwoods for your attacker to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you really want to do me a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be for the best if you could\Nforget your worries and just enjoy the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get a limited number of\Nopportunities like this in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to waste this one\Njust because someone wants you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worrying about you is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does this thing work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the camera work to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but we\Nmust have gotten separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, but you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're at a crossroads between life and\Ndeath as a sacrifice to Lord Chladni.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought I'd end up getting a\Nchance to drink with my precious daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, father. You told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you pick me to\Ntake over the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have placed so much trust\Nin you just because you're my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was my worst mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you already knew that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attempting something beyond your limits\Nwill only lead to one thing, Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you're never going to\Nbe strong. Accept it and just let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you have expectations to live up to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mine and everyone else's\Nmust be hard on you!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an7\bord4\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs30\fnGeorgia\fscx90\c&H7C452F&\pos(23.33,24)}Hard on you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.09,0:07:51.85,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an9\bord4\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs30\fnGeorgia\fscx90\c&H7C452F&\pos(610,24)}Hard on you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and not worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.84,0:07:57.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\an7\bord4\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs30\fnGeorgia\fscx90\c&H7C452F&\pos(23.33,24)}Hard on you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's all worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt so alive when they\Nenjoyed my magic show!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll never be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I push\Nmyself, and even if I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't take the easy way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done being afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a long way down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rubber's too shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broke my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I die like this, I'll be letting\Ndown everyone who's ever protected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a water-absorbent polymer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They needed to make it look\Nlike a suicide or accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your relatives would be\Nsuspects and could end
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up losing a lot more\Nthan their inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything down to the last\Ndetail was planned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the legend of Lord\NChladni, all of it made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Sound Master Naruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a clever trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment she took that\Npicture at the photo op.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gale, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I was distracted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hit me with a shockwave and\Nscrambled my sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Separating me from Muresh, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lot fiercer\Nthan I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will super enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you said, suicide or accident,\NI only dance the way they pay me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.83,0:10:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too risky staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My knees gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.59,0:10:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't run,\Nbetter hop on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for preparing\Nme for this, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\fs20\an8\b1\blur0.3\3c&HC4C3C2&\c&H39363F&\pos(414,94)}I showed him\Nthe ropes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\fs20\b1\blur0.3\3c&HC4C3C2&\c&H39363F&\pos(414,312)}Mei Kinosaki
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I showed him the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not what I had in mind, but sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't\Nlet go of me. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.62,0:10:55.19,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\an7\fnImpact\fs50\bord4\alpha&H30&\blur0.3\shad0\c&H8170F5&\3c&H2B2219&\pos(26,13.33)}Modified Bloodline++\NMind Whisper
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, he's\Nmessing with our minds.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\an8\fs18\c&H1F1209&\pos(317,100)}Upper
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\an8\fs18\c&H1F1209&\pos(316,210)}Back
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\an8\fs18\c&H1F1209&\pos(319,316)}Lower
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical condition: fortissimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the secret modified\Nbloodline of the Poison Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Experiencing your toxic\Nvibes is a super rare treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, my mind whispers can reach\Nyou anywhere on this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escape is super impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshino, take these earplugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I think I practiced\Na thing for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitty, you're noise-canceling headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can pair them and talk to each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.03,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fnArial Black\shad0\bord2\blur0.3\fs50\fsp19\t(0,340,\fsp0)\t(340,590,\fsp12)\t(635,798,\fsp0)\t(890,1045,\fsp8)\t(1100,1200,\fsp5)\frz343.5\pos(413.34,71.33)\c&H2E8024&\3c&HD3DDC1&}Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look great on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.54,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fnArial Black\shad0\bord2\blur0.3\fs50\fsp19\t(0,340,\fsp0)\t(340,590,\fsp12)\t(635,798,\fsp0)\t(890,1045,\fsp8)\t(1100,1200,\fsp5)\c&H964324&\3c&HD3DDC1&\frz0.6902\pos(317.34,54)}Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mia, blocking your ears\Nisn't going to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my mind whispers stack together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blades have sound cut\Nright down to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:12:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't hear the attacks,\Nthen I'll feel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll max out my strength, as well\Nas sharpen my tactile senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin! Lunar Peak!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were smooth moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't save my target, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshino, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those attacks weren't meant for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hid her headphones with the vibrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not only her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This girl, she's a\Ntreasure trove of trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much material to work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can keep breaking her\Nwill over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to tell you\Nhow I really feel, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been nothing but a burden to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had to do all the work\Nand deal with the shareholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think your uncle\Nlet you go on this little trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got on board with the\Nplan to wipe you out. Sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nothing but a bunch of bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he chose me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your uncle interviewed a ton of\Nbodyguards looking for a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he kept hiring scumbags who\Nhad zero clue what they were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:14:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wound up shelling out a fortune\Nfor every contract he had to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason he reached out to me was\Nbecause of a Kray's 10,000-word review.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz17.5\fs20\fax0.3\bord0\shad0\pos(165,92)\c&HDEDDDD&}Username: Kitami
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz17.5\fs18\fax0.3\bord0\shad0\c&HDEDDDD&\pos(378,43)}Hime
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz17.5\fs25\b1\fax0.25\bord0\shad0\c&HDEDDDD&\pos(148,185)}Truly, he is a savior
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\fax0.28\bord0\shad0\c&HBFBBBE&\pos(456,114)\frz18.87}Sent from heaven to \Naid us in our time\Nof need!!!!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs20\fax0.22\bord0\shad0\c&HBFBBBE&\frz19.96\pos(310,264)}He's the greatest, frfrfrfrfr!!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs16\fax0.26\bord0\shad0\c&HBFBBBE&\pos(430,280)\frz21.45}I thought we'd have to\N\hsell our organs at first,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs16\fax0.26\bord0\shad0\c&HBFBBBE&\frz21.45\pos(580,254.67)}but he was \Nfriendly and\Nchill. He gets five stars\N from me!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He trusted you'd be safe in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would he have gone through all this\Ntrouble if he didn't care about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yurei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ureshino, but\NI need you to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dealing with a poison master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously he would be able to\Nnavigate around my illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can hear me, can't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.16,0:14:43.04,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord6\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\b1\fs40\pos(32,15)\c&H000000&\3c&H7C286A&}Trauma\N{\3c&HAC6928&}Trauma
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your illusions and\Nbrainwashing tricks drag out traumatic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memories from deep within a person's\Nsubconscious and amplify them.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.80,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord6\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\3c&H7C286A&\pos(382.67,35.33)}Trauma\N{\3c&HAC6928&}Trauma
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she has a messy situation at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yes, her uncle did give\Nher permission to go camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's only a small\Npart of the bigger picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:15:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was tempted for a second to let her\Ngo, and you amped up his urge to give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshino knows she has weaknesses,\Nbut she's fighting to overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't need you\Ngiving her a hard time.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.04,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,280)}Lord {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}Chladni
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, that's really\Nstrange. According to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my phone the two of them\Nshould be right here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are wait a minute what the heck
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.31,0:15:36.39,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs30\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord4.5\pos(169.71,310)\c&H060606&\3c&H000000&}Why the ears?!\NWhy carry her like that?!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:34.31,0:15:36.39,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs30\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord3\pos(169.71,310)\c&H060606&\3c&HF5F5F5&}Why the ears?!\NWhy carry her like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you were running late\Ni'm glad i put a gps tracker on her
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.06,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1.2\shad0\blur0.3\fs18\an8\b1\blur0.3\3c&HE6E7E2&\c&H39363F&\pos(177.33,126)}Courtesy\Nof me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.66,0:15:44.06,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1.5\shad0\blur0.3\fs25\b1\blur0.3\3c&HE6E7E2&\c&H39363F&\pos(175,270)}Kitami
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courtesy of me kitami got a little work\Nrelated injury i pushed myself a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tracking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Ureshino and get\Naway from this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. I... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:16:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to complete his mission,\Nhe'll need to eliminate me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already spoiled his plans twice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to take him out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, while I'm tied\Nup, I need you to keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as your marriage advisor,\Nthat's outside my purview.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make an exception, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So selfless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see your headphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took a big risk\Ngetting that close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He planted this to enhance his\Nillusions and brainwashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as his abilities go, I\Ndon't know the full extent of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to fight me\Nface to face, I'll drag you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I go after the target, I might\Nend up with a syringe in my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get that Poison Master out of my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hair that I can take\Nmy time with Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how this tune goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've never felt readier to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just got a lot more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic gases dissipate\Nin the great outdoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for poison needles, they're essentially\Nuseless unless you're able to locate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you use those tricks of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I dissolve your wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It bounced off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.55,0:17:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strings vibrate at super high speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way for Liquid to bind to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the climax can finally begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++. Grand Actor.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.11,0:18:23.26,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\an7\fnImpact\fs50\bord4\alpha&H30&\blur0.3\shad0\c&H8170F5&\3c&H4B1C06&\pos(26,13.33)}Modified Bloodline++\NGrand Actor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do, Poison Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the trees instead of the wires?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I would have sensed it if he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.93,0:19:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't wither them with poison either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, they look healthier than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice friends you've got.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.20,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnArial\b1\an1\fs16\fax-0.4\fscy110\frz29\pos(145,136)\c&H436018&}Bulk Up Your Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to like my medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your technique's hard to tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's its one weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the trees continue growing,\Nyou can't play precise notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear is buried deep down inside\Na person's psyche, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already sown the seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left for me to\Ndo is to allow them to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you two been?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a huge emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the only way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone started feeling sick\Nduring the Test of Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried driving them to\Nthe hospital, but, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These mountains are too\Ndangerous for amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.75,0:20:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the wrath of Lord Chladni!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sacrifice must be made!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to follow the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To appease Lord Chladni,\Nwe must offer up a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must determine who here\Namong us is the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever has the latest birthday will\Nbe sacrificed to halt his wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New students, take out\Nyour IDs so we can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,September 27th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,February 4th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,October 10th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May 5th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,March 20th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born in March on the 31st.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, if you think you can\Nstop the seeds of panic from growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nuntil the target dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never stop pursuing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.31,0:21:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, unless you're able to defeat me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.95,0:21:54.22,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8AB50&\bord1.5\b1\shad0\blur0.3\fs15\t(30,1400,\fs60)\an7\q2\3c&HFFFDDF&\move(640,15,-2050,15)}FWEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEP
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A violin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.59,0:22:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the Soundmaster's\Nmodified bloodline increments!
